    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immerse yourself in a world hidden away and revisit the past of this young girl.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through a seamless and interwoven open world, uncovering the legacies left behind. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/8c120178ddf5c2156d8741e1054e002d.poster.avif?t=1742312968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/8c120178ddf5c2156d8741e1054e002d.webm?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/8c120178ddf5c2156d8741e1054e002d.mp4?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and gather scattered petals to unlock hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/417df128f551ace6b378cce68e408243.poster.avif?t=1742312968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/417df128f551ace6b378cce68e408243.webm?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/417df128f551ace6b378cce68e408243.mp4?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact and help out the local fauna to assist you on your journey.  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/920b8da4c3012157e8b904a2a9908f49.poster.avif?t=1742312968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/920b8da4c3012157e8b904a2a9908f49.webm?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/920b8da4c3012157e8b904a2a9908f49.mp4?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an emotionally gripping story about a trapped girl and a cosmic wolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/03904d4f992a1df906b4f8feb0452d2e.poster.avif?t=1742312968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/03904d4f992a1df906b4f8feb0452d2e.webm?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/03904d4f992a1df906b4f8feb0452d2e.mp4?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a world where every corner holds a secret, every item tells a story, and every step brings you closer to unraveling a shared past steeped in mystery and emotion.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immerse yourself in a world hidden away and revisit the past of this young girl.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through a seamless and interwoven open world, uncovering the legacies left behind. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/8c120178ddf5c2156d8741e1054e002d.poster.avif?t=1742312968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/8c120178ddf5c2156d8741e1054e002d.webm?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/8c120178ddf5c2156d8741e1054e002d.mp4?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and gather scattered petals to unlock hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/417df128f551ace6b378cce68e408243.poster.avif?t=1742312968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/417df128f551ace6b378cce68e408243.webm?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/417df128f551ace6b378cce68e408243.mp4?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact and help out the local fauna to assist you on your journey.  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/920b8da4c3012157e8b904a2a9908f49.poster.avif?t=1742312968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/920b8da4c3012157e8b904a2a9908f49.webm?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/920b8da4c3012157e8b904a2a9908f49.mp4?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an emotionally gripping story about a trapped girl and a cosmic wolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/03904d4f992a1df906b4f8feb0452d2e.poster.avif?t=1742312968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/03904d4f992a1df906b4f8feb0452d2e.webm?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/03904d4f992a1df906b4f8feb0452d2e.mp4?t=1742312968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a world where every corner holds a secret, every item tells a story, and every step brings you closer to unraveling a shared past steeped in mystery and emotion.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a seamless and colorful world while being hunted by a cosmic wolf in this beautiful third-person adventure game. Uncover the scarred past of Velarune by solving puzzles and collecting petals to open the way. Discover the secrets of this secluded land before time runs out\u2026",
